    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a module splitting proposal. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Proposals are made of N BitVectors, one for each partition, where each bit set indicates that the node is present and should be copied inside that partition.</para>
<para>Proposals have several metrics attached so they can be compared/sorted, which the driver to try multiple strategies resultings in multiple proposals and choose the best one out of them. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
